 "notes": "CardDemo's card detail screen (transaction CCDL, program COCRDSLC): from the menu it sends the empty screen; from the card list it reads the selected card and shows it; re-entered it edits the account and card filters (blank, '*', zero, not numeric), reads the card by number and shows it; PF3 returns to the caller or the menu; any other key acts as ENTER. 9150-GETCARD-BYACCT (the account path) is never performed. Every file is the corpus's own data. Derived from CardDemo (Apache-2.0; Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates): LICENSE and NOTICE here are the source's own."
